From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nmbath <bathnm@icloud.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 18:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] cmake: detect cross-builds on aarch64 hosts

An aarch64 target and host have matching processor names even when Yocto
is cross-compiling. This selects desktop mode and omits the install rules.

Use CMake's cross-compilation state instead.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 cmake/BuildDefines.cmake | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/cmake/BuildDefines.cmake
+++ b/cmake/BuildDefines.cmake
@@ -11 +11 @@
-if (${CMAKE_SYSTEM_PROCESSOR} STREQUAL ${CMAKE_HOST_SYSTEM_PROCESSOR})
+if (NOT CMAKE_CROSSCOMPILING)
